Key Enterprise Architect Principles Applied:
----------------------------------------------
Security by default: Private networking, NSGs, policies enforce compliance from day one.

Least privilege: RBAC limits access; teams are autonomous within guardrails.

Repeatability: Terraform modules + pipelines make infrastructure code auditable and versionable.

Resilience: Multi-region ARO + Traffic Manager ensure failover capability.

Cost governance: Budgets, right-sizing and auto-shutdown prevent waste.

Observability: Centralised logging and monitoring detect issues early.
